# SC2 5.0.15 Patch Data - CHANGES LOG

## Method
Built from 5.0.14.94137 baseline + Blizzard 5.0.15 patch notes + 5.0.15 hotfix.
Verified against SC2 Editor Balance Data Export (SC2 5.0.16 install, which includes 5.0.15 changes).

## Successfully Changed (HIGH confidence — verified against Editor export)

### UnitData.xml
- VikingFighter cost: added Minerals=125, Vespene=75 (was 150/75) ✅
- Spire cost: added Minerals=150, Vespene=150 (was 200/200) ✅
- Liberator sight: added SightRadius=9 (was 10) ✅
- Ghost supply: Food=-3→-2 ✅
- Ghost Light attribute: added Attributes index="Light" value="1" ✅
- Mothership speed: 2.0156→1.6054 (2.83→2.25 in game units) ✅
- BroodLord speed: 1.875→1.6015 (2.62→2.24 in game units, hotfix) ✅

## NOT Changed (LOW confidence — not in patch XMLs or not verifiable from per-unit Editor export)

### Zerg
- Spire build time: 71→66s (in ability/build data, not in patch XMLs)
