- Microbial Shroud: 50% ranged damage reduction (behavior data)
- Microbial Shroud: no longer persists after leaving (behavior data)
- Microbial Shroud cost: 75→100 (ability data)
- Microbial Shroud: requires upgrade again 150/150 (requirement data)

### Protoss
- Energy Recharge: 100→50 energy, cooldown 60→45s (Nexus ability data)
- Psi Storm: 80/3s→140/6s (hotfix: 110/6s), radius 1.5→2, range 9→8 (effect/ability data)
- DT Blink attack delay: 0.75→0.25 (weapon/behavior data)
- Observer Surveillance: reveals Observers, vision 13.75→15 (behavior data)
- Purification cooldown: 21.4→17s (ability data)
- Stasis Ward duration: 170→90s (behavior data)

### Terran
- Siege Tank can't be abducted in siege mode (validator data)
- Drilling Claws effectiveness: 1.07→0.71s (upgrade effect data)
- Hyperflight Rotors research time: 100→79s (upgrade data)

